  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0: Live Observable Collections - Added ObservableConcurrentDictionary and ObservableConcurrentList with INotifyCollectionChanged for UI binding (WPF/MAUI/Avalonia). EntityCache now exposes live observable collections (LiveGuilds, LiveChannels, LiveMembers) for real-time UI data binding. Supports batch operations to prevent UI thrashing on large servers. Optional SynchronizationContext for automatic UI thread marshaling. Backward compatible - all snapshot-based APIs preserved.",
